WEBVTT

00:05.920 --> 00:08.460
<b>-When Hapna went on sale
3 years ago,</b>

00:08.590 --> 00:12.340
<b>minors were strictly
prohibited from using it.</b>

00:12.420 --> 00:17.300
<b>But in the underground scene,
it was a craze among us kids.</b>

00:17.430 --> 00:22.140
<b>Adults didn't understand why we
would want to use painkillers.</b>

00:22.270 --> 00:25.310
<b>Then all it took was
a single rumor.</b>

00:25.440 --> 00:29.730
<b>"Hapna is a drug
that can get rid of sadness."</b>

00:29.820 --> 00:32.610
<b>The word spread like wildfire.</b>

00:32.690 --> 00:36.990
<b>Dealers started selling it
to us at jacked-up prices.</b>

00:37.120 --> 00:38.450
<b>I took it, too.</b>

00:38.580 --> 00:42.410
<b>Since my own feelings
were too much for me to handle.</b>

00:42.500 --> 00:44.790
<b>It seemed crazy that
Skinner found a way</b>

00:44.910 --> 00:47.500
<b>to control human emotions.</b>

00:47.630 --> 00:51.590
<b>I started to think of him
as a god.</b>

00:51.670 --> 00:56.680
<b>Needless to say, he betrayed
all those expectations,</b>

00:56.800 --> 00:59.260
<b>but just maybe...</b>

01:03.350 --> 01:05.640
<b>[ Theme music plays ]</b>

01:05.770 --> 01:13.070
<b>♪♪</b>

01:13.150 --> 01:23.080
<b>♪♪</b>

01:23.160 --> 01:33.090
<b>♪♪</b>

01:33.170 --> 01:43.100
<b>♪♪</b>

01:43.180 --> 01:53.110
<b>♪♪</b>

01:53.190 --> 02:03.120
<b>♪♪</b>

02:03.200 --> 02:13.130
<b>♪♪</b>

02:13.210 --> 02:23.140
<b>♪♪</b>

02:23.220 --> 02:32.310
<b>♪♪</b>

02:33.980 --> 02:35.530
<b>-Dr. 909.</b>

02:35.610 --> 02:38.320
<b>One of the world's
most prolific hackers.</b>

02:38.400 --> 02:40.820
<b>Even the FBI hasn't been
able to identify him.</b>

02:40.910 --> 02:44.080
<b>But thanks to Elaina,
we located his hidden wallet.</b>

02:44.200 --> 02:46.580
<b>-What's a "hidden wallet"?
-Well,</b>

02:46.660 --> 02:49.580
<b>think of it like a bank ledger
for cryptocurrencies.</b>

02:49.710 --> 02:53.960
<b>-Looking into it, we found a
highly unusual influx of funds.</b>

02:54.090 --> 02:56.420
<b>-Whoa!
-Is this for real?</b>

02:56.500 --> 02:58.420
<b>-That's an insane
amount of money.</b>

02:58.550 --> 03:01.260
<b>-Right before Skinner made
his announcement,</b>

03:01.340 --> 03:03.600
<b>a stock trader named Sam
deposited a large amount</b>

03:03.680 --> 03:05.510
<b>of money into 909's account.</b>

03:05.600 --> 03:08.180
<b>-From the looks of it,
the guy knew ahead of time</b>

03:08.270 --> 03:09.930
<b>that Hapna stocks would plummet.</b>

03:10.020 --> 03:13.350
<b>He sold off a whole bunch of
them just before the news hit.</b>

03:13.440 --> 03:14.770
<b>-But how could this guy know?</b>

03:14.860 --> 03:17.440
<b>-Dr. Skinner's
plan started 3 years ago,</b>

03:17.570 --> 03:20.740
<b>when he disappeared and
erased all traces of himself.</b>

03:20.820 --> 03:22.490
<b>It should be impossible
to pull that off</b>

03:22.610 --> 03:24.490
<b>without the help
of a top-tier hacker.</b>

03:24.620 --> 03:28.450
<b>-So, basically, this 909 guy
helped Skinner disappear</b>

03:28.540 --> 03:30.000
<b>in exchange for Hapna info.</b>

03:30.120 --> 03:33.170
<b>Then got with Sam
to cash in before the crash.</b>

03:33.290 --> 03:36.000
<b>-That seems like
the natural conclusion.</b>

03:36.130 --> 03:40.130
<b>-Okay. All we gotta do now
is catch this 909 fella.</b>

03:40.260 --> 03:41.630
<b>-You make it so sound easy.</b>

03:41.720 --> 03:43.640
<b>-In the meantime,
Elaina is going to keep</b>

03:43.720 --> 03:45.760
<b>monitoring the wallet
for any movement.</b>

03:45.850 --> 03:48.180
<b>The rest of you
go and hunt down Sam.</b>

03:48.310 --> 03:53.060
<b>It seems highly likely that he's
in regular contact with 909.</b>

03:53.140 --> 03:55.270
<b>[ Cat meows ]</b>

03:55.360 --> 03:56.900
<b>-Unh!
[ Muffled shouting ]</b>

03:56.980 --> 03:59.190
<b>Meow! Meow, meow, meow!</b>

03:59.320 --> 04:02.610
<b>-Sam Stephenson.
The stock trader.</b>

04:02.700 --> 04:05.240
<b>-Just another investor
who's rolling in the dough.</b>

04:05.320 --> 04:06.660
<b>-Definitely not a fan.</b>

04:06.740 --> 04:09.160
<b>-I bet this guy's
a narcissistic rich asshole</b>

04:09.290 --> 04:12.330
<b>who thinks he's a hotshot,
who makes women wait on him.</b>

04:12.410 --> 04:14.870
<b>-Settle down.
Let's not jump to conclusions.</b>

04:15.000 --> 04:18.420
<b>-Let's see what his
social media presence is like.</b>

04:19.050 --> 04:21.010
<b>-Ha!
-Hey!</b>

04:21.090 --> 04:23.760
<b>-It's all about Hapna!</b>

04:23.840 --> 04:26.050
<b>Ah!
Mmm!</b>

04:26.180 --> 04:28.010
<b>Nothing to stress about.</b>

04:28.140 --> 04:29.560
<b>[ All cheering ]</b>

04:29.680 --> 04:32.890
<b>The only stuff I like to keep
around my club...</b>

04:33.020 --> 04:35.440
<b>is the hottest stuff!</b>

04:36.020 --> 04:37.020
<b>[ All exclaim ]</b>

04:37.110 --> 04:39.190
<b>-Just as bad as I thought!</b>

04:39.270 --> 04:40.650
<b>Talk about a total sleazebag!</b>

04:40.730 --> 04:42.940
<b>How is this guy for real?
-Ugh.</b>

04:43.030 --> 04:45.860
<b>So, what do we gotta do
to meet this jackass?</b>

04:45.990 --> 04:49.120
<b>♪♪</b>

04:49.200 --> 04:53.200
<b>-Sam throws a party at one
of his clubs every weekend.</b>

04:53.290 --> 04:54.710
<b>He likes to pick out
attractive women</b>

04:54.790 --> 04:57.210
<b>to join him in the VIP area.</b>

04:57.290 --> 04:59.040
<b>-All right, then.</b>

04:59.170 --> 05:01.340
<b>I take it that's
where I come in.</b>

05:01.420 --> 05:04.380
<b>♪♪</b>

05:04.470 --> 05:07.180
<b>-Hold up!
Why I am dressed like a girl?</b>

05:07.260 --> 05:08.680
<b>-For insurance.</b>

05:08.760 --> 05:11.430
<b>We have no idea what type of
woman this guy is into.</b>

05:11.560 --> 05:12.680
<b>-I gotta say, though,</b>

05:12.770 --> 05:14.390
<b>it's actually
a good look on you.</b>

05:14.520 --> 05:16.770
<b>No, seriously,
you're a real cutie.</b>

05:16.890 --> 05:19.230
<b>-Hey! Personal space!
-Hey, heartbreaker.</b>

05:19.360 --> 05:20.690
<b>-Stop goofing around, you two.</b>

05:20.770 --> 05:22.900
<b>-Cut it out!
-Let's go.</b>

05:22.980 --> 05:32.040
<b>♪♪</b>

05:32.120 --> 05:33.660
<b>-No way!
This is wild!</b>

05:33.750 --> 05:36.040
<b>They've booked Visionary
as tonight's DJ?!</b>

05:36.120 --> 05:37.330
<b>-Wow.
-What's the big deal?</b>

05:37.420 --> 05:38.750
<b>Is he famous?
-Huh?</b>

05:38.880 --> 05:40.960
<b>You've never heard of him?
-Aw, yeah!</b>

05:41.090 --> 05:42.340
<b>It's time to have some fun!</b>

05:42.420 --> 05:44.210
<b>-Remember,
we're not here to party.</b>

05:44.300 --> 05:46.470
<b>-Yeah, I'm aware.</b>

05:46.590 --> 05:49.390
<b>-Huh? This shouldn't
even be possible.</b>

05:49.470 --> 05:51.430
<b>-What's wrong?
-It's regarding the locations</b>

05:51.550 --> 05:54.100
<b>of the deposits made
over the last 2 weeks.</b>

05:54.220 --> 05:55.220
<b>I'll show you.</b>

05:55.310 --> 05:57.890
<b>-London, Boston, Lyon, Osaka.</b>

05:57.980 --> 06:00.150
<b>They're happening
all over the world.</b>

06:00.270 --> 06:04.150
<b>-And what's more, every single
one took place at physical ATMs.</b>

06:04.280 --> 06:05.940
<b>-Does this mean
he hired someone</b>

06:06.070 --> 06:08.530
<b>to make the deposits
for him and avoid being tracked.</b>

06:08.610 --> 06:10.160
<b>-That doesn't make sense.</b>

06:10.280 --> 06:11.370
<b>He would have to meet
them in person</b>

06:11.450 --> 06:13.030
<b>to pass off the access device.</b>

06:13.120 --> 06:16.040
<b>-In any event, the security
cameras at the ATMs,</b>

06:16.120 --> 06:18.330
<b>should've caught somebody
making the deposits.</b>

06:18.460 --> 06:21.130
<b>-Okay. I'll try
looking into them.</b>

06:21.210 --> 06:22.920
<b>[ Dance music plays ]</b>

06:23.000 --> 06:32.300
<b>♪♪</b>

06:32.430 --> 06:34.010
<b>♪♪</b>

06:34.140 --> 06:37.640
<b>-Come on. We need to look
the part of a couple.</b>

06:37.770 --> 06:39.980
<b>-Hm.
-[ Chuckles ]</b>

06:40.100 --> 06:42.980
<b>[ Both groan ]</b>

06:43.110 --> 06:45.780
<b>♪♪</b>

06:45.860 --> 06:48.490
<b>-We're going to infiltrate
in two teams.</b>

06:48.610 --> 06:50.700
<b><i>Obviously, we can't</i>
<i>bring in any weapons.</i></b>

06:50.820 --> 06:53.200
<b><i>Ladies, your mission</i>
<i>is to catch Sam's eye</i></b>

06:53.320 --> 06:54.620
<b><i>by putting on a show</i></b>

06:54.700 --> 06:56.450
<b><i>and waiting for</i>
<i>his personal invite.</i></b>

06:56.540 --> 06:58.790
<b><i>If you manage to</i>
<i>establish contact with him,</i></b>

06:58.870 --> 07:00.830
<b><i>lure him to a secluded area.</i></b>

07:00.920 --> 07:02.630
<b><i>-What if he doesn't choose us?</i></b>

07:02.710 --> 07:05.550
<b>-We switch to plan B.
We go kick his ass.</b>

07:05.670 --> 07:07.170
<b><i>-There is no plan B.</i></b>

07:07.260 --> 07:08.840
<b><i>This is his turf.</i></b>

07:08.970 --> 07:11.010
<b><i>And the last thing</i>
<i>we want is for him to run off</i></b>

07:11.130 --> 07:12.840
<b><i>because we caused a scene.</i></b>

07:12.970 --> 07:22.850
<b>♪♪</b>

07:22.980 --> 07:27.400
<b>♪♪</b>

07:27.530 --> 07:28.650
<b>-Oh!</b>

07:28.730 --> 07:31.030
<b>I haven't been to
a club in forever!</b>

07:31.150 --> 07:32.160
<b>-Ah!</b>

07:32.240 --> 07:33.280
<b>-Hold on!</b>

07:33.360 --> 07:43.290
<b>♪♪</b>

07:43.370 --> 07:53.300
<b>♪♪</b>

07:53.380 --> 07:55.850
<b>♪♪</b>

07:55.930 --> 07:57.470
<b>-Unh!</b>

07:59.680 --> 08:00.850
<b>Uh, pardon me.</b>

08:00.930 --> 08:02.980
<b>♪♪</b>

08:03.060 --> 08:06.060
<b>-Sorry. Only authorized
personnel allowed upstairs.</b>

08:06.190 --> 08:09.570
<b>-Oh, yeah?
-You're in the way, dude!</b>

08:09.690 --> 08:11.900
<b>♪♪</b>

08:12.030 --> 08:13.400
<b>[ Beeping ]</b>

08:13.530 --> 08:15.780
<b>These guys are with me.</b>

08:16.740 --> 08:18.620
<b>-His security is heavily armed.</b>

08:18.740 --> 08:20.870
<b>-It looks like
the VIP lounge is upstairs.</b>

08:20.950 --> 08:24.040
<b>You need some kinda digital
tattoo to gain access.</b>

08:24.120 --> 08:25.460
<b>[ Beeps ]</b>

08:25.580 --> 08:31.170
<b>♪♪</b>

08:31.260 --> 08:32.510
<b>-Hmm.</b>

08:32.590 --> 08:34.720
<b>They certainly appear
to be the same person.</b>

08:34.800 --> 08:36.680
<b>-But none of them
show their faces,</b>

08:36.760 --> 08:38.600
<b>so I can't identify them.</b>

08:38.680 --> 08:40.470
<b>♪♪</b>

08:40.600 --> 08:42.270
<b>-Hit me with another.</b>

08:43.770 --> 08:46.770
<b>Thank you.
Just put it on this guy's tab.</b>

08:46.900 --> 08:48.730
<b>-That's enough. Slow down.</b>

08:48.810 --> 08:51.150
<b>-Aw, this is just pre-game
for me.</b>

08:51.280 --> 08:53.440
<b>-Barkeep! A shot of tequila!</b>

08:53.570 --> 08:58.280
<b>♪♪</b>

08:58.370 --> 09:00.620
<b>Ooh! That's it.</b>

09:00.700 --> 09:05.540
<b>♪♪</b>

09:05.620 --> 09:06.960
<b>-Excuse me.</b>

09:07.040 --> 09:08.880
<b>Is Sam really
going to show tonight?</b>

09:08.960 --> 09:11.460
<b>-It's hard to say.
Every once in a while,</b>

09:11.590 --> 09:14.260
<b>the owner does make
his own appearances.</b>

09:14.340 --> 09:15.880
<b>-Oh, boo!</b>

09:15.970 --> 09:18.010
<b>I really wanted get
a good selfie with him.</b>

09:18.140 --> 09:21.350
<b>-[ Clears throat ]
Well, just between you and me,</b>

09:21.470 --> 09:23.220
<b>he always shows up with the DJ,</b>

09:23.310 --> 09:25.560
<b>and they arrive by helicopter.</b>

09:25.640 --> 09:26.980
<b>-Why, thank you.</b>

09:27.100 --> 09:28.350
<b>-Mm-hmm.</b>

09:28.480 --> 09:29.270
<b>-Whoa!</b>

09:29.360 --> 09:30.480
<b>[ Grunts ]</b>

09:30.610 --> 09:32.980
<b>[ Chuckles, sighs ]</b>

09:33.110 --> 09:36.280
<b>[ Chuckles ]</b>

09:36.360 --> 09:38.320
<b>Unh!</b>

09:41.490 --> 09:43.580
<b>[ Beeping ]</b>

09:43.660 --> 09:45.410
<b>♪♪</b>

09:45.500 --> 09:46.910
<b><i>-What are you doing?</i></b>

09:47.000 --> 09:48.830
<b><i>I thought I told you</i>
<i>to put on a show.</i></b>

09:48.960 --> 09:50.960
<b>-Then I'm gonna need help
getting comfortable out there.</b>

09:51.040 --> 09:53.000
<b>Why don't you come
and dance with me?</b>

09:53.130 --> 09:54.420
<b>-Huh?
<i>-Are you telling me</i></b>

09:54.510 --> 09:56.550
<b><i>you can't dance?</i></b>

09:56.670 --> 09:58.470
<b>-Of course I can dance.</b>

09:58.550 --> 10:08.480
<b>♪♪</b>

10:08.560 --> 10:10.810
<b>♪♪</b>

10:10.900 --> 10:12.690
<b>-That guy is a riot!</b>

10:12.770 --> 10:15.230
<b>-He's getting
all of the attention.</b>

10:15.360 --> 10:16.780
<b>Huh?</b>

10:16.860 --> 10:18.450
<b>-I don't get this place.</b>

10:18.530 --> 10:21.570
<b>I danced my butt off
but didn't get an invite.</b>

10:21.700 --> 10:24.910
<b><i>-I just got picked up.</i>
-No way! That's BS!</b>

10:25.040 --> 10:27.040
<b>Where at?!
-Now that's funny.</b>

10:27.160 --> 10:30.080
<b>I guess they think he's
just better-looking than you.</b>

10:30.210 --> 10:31.670
<b>Ah!</b>

10:32.590 --> 10:34.590
<b>Uh, sorry.
Forget what I said.</b>

10:34.710 --> 10:36.710
<b>[ Helicopter blades whirring ]</b>

10:36.800 --> 10:42.010
<b>♪♪</b>

10:42.090 --> 10:44.850
<b>-What's up, Laura?!
-Hi, Chris!</b>

10:44.930 --> 10:46.350
<b>-Who's this bitch?!</b>

10:46.430 --> 10:47.600
<b>-You can't cut in line!</b>

10:47.730 --> 10:48.850
<b>-Let's go, girl!</b>

10:48.930 --> 10:51.650
<b>Don't want to keep Sam
waiting for us.</b>

10:53.810 --> 10:57.440
<b>-Huh? The wallet just
updated with a new transaction.</b>

10:57.570 --> 10:59.070
<b>-Where did it happen?</b>

10:59.150 --> 11:00.570
<b>-Babylonia City.</b>

11:00.700 --> 11:03.530
<b>This is actually
really close to us!</b>

11:03.620 --> 11:07.240
<b>♪♪</b>

11:10.330 --> 11:13.920
<b>♪♪</b>

11:14.040 --> 11:16.460
<b>-All right, everyone!
Let me introduce you!</b>

11:16.590 --> 11:20.420
<b>Say hello to the special DJ
who I booked for today's event!</b>

11:20.510 --> 11:23.340
<b><i>The </i>Visionary!
-Hey.</b>

11:23.430 --> 11:26.760
<b>[ Women screaming ]</b>

11:26.890 --> 11:29.730
<b>-Perfect.
They made contact with Sam.</b>

11:29.810 --> 11:31.810
<b>-And now it's our turn.</b>

11:31.940 --> 11:33.730
<b>-Hey, there, I'm Diana!</b>

11:33.810 --> 11:36.480
<b>And this little cutie is Laura.
Right?</b>

11:36.610 --> 11:40.280
<b>-[ Scoffs ] Like we give
a flying crap about your names.</b>

11:41.360 --> 11:42.610
<b>[ Chuckles ]</b>

11:42.700 --> 11:45.120
<b>Hey, what are those?
Stock prices?</b>

11:45.240 --> 11:48.040
<b>You're doing money-making
stuff right now?</b>

11:48.120 --> 11:50.290
<b>-We have an AI that does
all the trading for us.</b>

11:50.410 --> 11:53.670
<b>So we just watch millions
of dollars move by the second.</b>

11:53.790 --> 11:55.290
<b>-Delta's getting dropped
like a rock.</b>

11:55.420 --> 11:57.630
<b>-I know about that!
It's 'cause of Hapna!</b>

11:57.750 --> 12:00.170
<b>-Yeah, right!
Females don't know anything!</b>

12:00.300 --> 12:01.470
<b>-[ Laughs ]</b>

12:01.550 --> 12:03.590
<b>-Skinner is the bomb!</b>

12:03.680 --> 12:04.890
<b>[ Both sigh ]</b>

12:04.970 --> 12:06.640
<b>-Aren't you afraid
of Hapna killing us?</b>

12:06.760 --> 12:08.010
<b>-Eh, why should I?</b>

12:08.140 --> 12:09.810
<b>Somebody'll figure out a cure.</b>

12:09.930 --> 12:11.890
<b>-And then, we're gonna
make millions off of it.</b>

12:11.980 --> 12:14.230
<b>-That's how we do it!</b>

12:14.310 --> 12:16.110
<b>[ Laughter ]</b>

12:16.190 --> 12:17.650
<b>-You're so cool.</b>

12:17.730 --> 12:18.980
<b>-I know, right?</b>

12:19.070 --> 12:20.900
<b>Huh?</b>

12:20.990 --> 12:23.490
<b>-Oh, sorry.
She's just a little shy.</b>

12:23.570 --> 12:25.410
<b>I like that. It's cute.</b>

12:25.490 --> 12:26.910
<b>Let's go somewhere private.</b>

12:26.990 --> 12:30.330
<b>-I'm surprised, Visionary.
You got kinky tastes!</b>

12:30.450 --> 12:31.870
<b>-Shut up, man.
-Uh...</b>

12:32.000 --> 12:33.160
<b>[ Whimpering ]</b>

12:33.290 --> 12:36.380
<b>-Here we go!
It's punch-bowl time!</b>

12:36.500 --> 12:38.500
<b>Yeah!</b>

12:39.340 --> 12:40.460
<b>-Huh?</b>

12:40.550 --> 12:41.800
<b>Hey, wait a minute.</b>

12:41.880 --> 12:45.680
<b>♪♪</b>

12:45.800 --> 12:48.720
<b>-It was Laura, wasn't it?
-Uh, well, it --</b>

12:48.850 --> 12:52.680
<b>-Listen, those other women
seemed like a bunch of sluts.</b>

12:52.810 --> 12:56.060
<b>They don't spark my interest.
-Huh?</b>

12:56.190 --> 12:59.150
<b>-Let me put it this way.
My type of woman...</b>

12:59.230 --> 13:02.070
<b>is someone innocent
and still untouched.</b>

13:02.190 --> 13:05.200
<b>Almost translucent?
If that makes sense.</b>

13:05.280 --> 13:07.990
<b>-Hey, uh, your set is
starting sometime soon.</b>

13:08.070 --> 13:09.910
<b>Isn't it?
-Eh.</b>

13:10.030 --> 13:12.160
<b>I leave all the songs
and that stuff to the AI.</b>

13:12.240 --> 13:13.830
<b>-Huh?
-I don't give a crap</b>

13:13.910 --> 13:15.370
<b>about music or whatever.</b>

13:15.500 --> 13:19.420
<b>The only reason I'm a DJ is
to be popular with the ladies.</b>

13:19.540 --> 13:22.510
<b>-It's showtime, sir.
Please come to the booth.</b>

13:22.590 --> 13:23.380
<b>-Mm.</b>

13:23.510 --> 13:25.970
<b>♪♪</b>

